    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="1ad7abaa-2be9-5967-b185-71a9843b0ae0" activityNameId="55f42d6a-a457-5583-a1a4-a1afac68e0ad" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">2-methyl-2-butanol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 2-methyl-2-butanol, at plant
The process "2-methyl-2-butanol, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of 2-methyl-2-butanol from hydration of 2-methyl-2-pentane in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with data from a similar process. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000075-85-4; 
Formula: C5H12O; 
UUID: 27db933e-38fd-3c3c-9414-35ef0c39f3e8
Production of 2-methyl-2-butanol including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hydration of 2-methyl-2-pentane
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_27db933e-38fd-3c3c-9414-35ef0c39f3e8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
